---@class posthog.subscriptions.AIWindowConfig
---@field mode? posthog.subscriptions.SubscriptionAIWindowModeEnum|string What the report analyzes each run: * `since_last_sent` (default) — everything since the previous successful scheduled delivery (gap-free; test/manual sends don't move the anchor) * `last_n_days` — a fixed trailing window of start_days_ago days * `days_ago_range` — the explicit range from start_days_ago to end_days_ago days ago * `since_last_sent` - Since last report * `last_n_days` - Last N days * `days_ago_range` - Between X and Y days ago
---@field start_days_ago? number|distilled.Null Lower bound of the analysis window, in days before the run. Required for 'last_n_days' (the N) and 'days_ago_range'; ignored for 'since_last_sent'. 1-365.
---@field end_days_ago? number|distilled.Null Upper bound of the analysis window, in days before the run (0 = now). Required for 'days_ago_range' and must be less than start_days_ago; ignored for other modes. 0-365.

